        "collapsible_tab_mjEF8T": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The Cupro™ bottle is shaped from <strong>solid 99.9% pure copper</strong>, hammered by hand, with no inner coating, no plastic, no paint. Just the metal.</p><ul><li>Copper is <strong>naturally antibacterial</strong>: it purifies the water resting inside it</li><li><strong>Zero plastic contact</strong>, zero shedding, zero microplastics</li><li>Every piece is unique: the hammering is done by hand</li><li>An object that lasts decades and <strong>gets more beautiful as it ages</strong></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_gBgAbF": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you need it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One plastic water bottle sheds over <strong>240,000 microplastic particles</strong> into your water. Any brand. They don't digest. They accumulate.</p><p>Your stainless bottle is better: it's neutral. But that's all it is. It just holds water.</p><p>Copper does more than not shed. <strong>It works for you.</strong> It's called the oligodynamic effect: known to Ayurvedic medicine for 5,000 years, documented by modern microbiology. Copper naturally neutralizes bacteria in the water that rests against it.</p><p><strong>Your water deserves a vessel that purifies it, not one that contaminates it.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_akEwJj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits ✨",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>✓ <strong>Naturally purified water</strong> while it rests, no filter, no cartridge</p><p>✓ <strong>Zero plastic, zero toxins:</strong> pure copper with no inner coating</p><p>✓ <strong>A daily wellness ritual:</strong> filled at night, savored at sunrise</p><p>✓ <strong>A one-of-one artisan piece:</strong> hand-hammered, with a patina that turns noble over the years</p><p>✓ <strong>The last bottle you replace:</strong> solid copper lasts for decades</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_MTCgw9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The ritual (how to use it)",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>1.</strong> Fill the bottle at night.</p><p><strong>2.</strong> Let the copper work while you sleep (6 to 8 hours).</p><p><strong>3.</strong> Drink first thing in the morning. That's the Tamra Jal ritual, 5,000 years old and 10 seconds a day.</p><p>Care: half a lemon and a pinch of salt bring back the shine in 30 seconds. The patina that builds over time is natural, and proof your copper is uncoated.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_FPPE7p": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer a guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Yes: <strong>30 days, money back.</strong></p><p>Build the ritual for a month. If the taste of the water, the object, or the habit doesn't win you over, send it back and we refund every cent.</p>",
