      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_kP7dka": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does copper purify water?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It's the <strong>oligodynamic effect</strong>: copper ions naturally neutralize bacteria in water that rests against the metal. Leave water in the bottle <strong>6 to 8 hours</strong> (overnight) for the full effect. No filter, no chemicals.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jgAFHc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does the water taste different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Water rested in copper is often described as <strong>softer and rounder</strong>. It's subtle, and it's exactly what ritual keepers end up craving every morning.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qUEDkw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe to drink from copper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, within the classic ritual: water rested for a few hours picks up trace amounts of copper, far below recommended limits. Copper is actually an essential trace mineral your body needs. Just avoid storing acidic drinks (juice, soda) in it for days.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FCYENr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The copper is darkening. Is that normal?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes: that's the <strong>natural patina</strong> of pure copper, and it's proof your bottle is neither lacquered nor plated. To bring back the day-one shine: half a lemon and a pinch of salt, 30 seconds.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JXE9KX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I care for it day to day?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Rinse with clear water, air dry. Once or twice a month: <strong>half a lemon and a pinch of salt</strong> inside and out, then rinse. No dishwasher, no abrasive sponge.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xwHJdL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and returns?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Free tracked shipping.</strong> Since every bottle is hammered by hand, allow the delivery window shown at checkout. And you're covered: <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>, simple return, full refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
